        "\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"MedicalClinic\",\n  \"@id\": \"https://tejomed.com/#clinic\",\n  \"name\": \"TejoMed\",\n  \"alternateName\": \"TejoMed Clinic\",\n  \"url\": \"https://tejomed.com\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://framerusercontent.com/images/kdsqMh3O4cQHstPXAVQKOnWnaA.png?lossless=1\",\n  \"image\": [\n    \"https://framerusercontent.com/images/cGRjcTrlp6uKVQypcenqtmFOxVA.webp\",\n    \"https://framerusercontent.com/images/hSmTA0d77ryQ3wrBa7wpUIpWZg.jpg\",\n    \"https://framerusercontent.com/images/sJvO6rXhGWXFb6JW0Hm0YdGU18.webp\"\n  ],\n  \"description\": \"TejoMed is a membership-based family medicine clinic in Lisbon offering dedicated, relationship-centered primary care with longer appointments, same or next-day urgent visits, comprehensive annual checkups, and personalized preventive care.\",\n  \"telephone\": \"+351210200900\",\n  \"email\": \"info@tejomed.com\",\n  \"priceRange\": \"$$\",\n  \"medicalSpecialty\": \"https://schema.org/PrimaryCare\",\n  \"parentOrganization\": { \"@id\": \"https://tejomed.com/#organization\" },\n  \"address\": {\n    \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n    \"streetAddress\": \"Praça da Alegria 66, 3º\",\n    \"addressLocality\": \"Lisboa\",\n    \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\",\n    \"postalCode\": \"1250-004\",\n    \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"\n  },\n  \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\n    \"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\",\n    \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\"],\n    \"opens\": \"09:00\",\n    \"closes\": \"18:00\"\n  },\n  \"identifier\": {\n    \"@type\": \"PropertyValue\",\n    \"propertyID\": \"NIPC\",\n",
        "\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How is TejoMed different from a traditional doctor?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The difference comes down to one number: patients. A traditional family doctor often carries thousands, which is why appointments feel rushed and getting seen takes so long. At TejoMed, each doctor keeps a small, limited panel so you get the same dedicated doctor every time, longer and unhurried appointments, and direct access to your care team when something comes up. Fewer patients, more time for you.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What does the membership fee cover?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Your membership fee covers the ongoing relationship with one dedicated doctor: the time, access, and attention that insurance typically does not pay for. That means a doctor who keeps a small patient panel and knows your history, longer and unhurried appointments that start on time, priority same or next-business-day access when you are unwell, direct phone and email messaging with your doctor and care team, 24/7 availability for urgent concerns, a comprehensive annual health assessment, in-clinic and virtual visits, and a secure patient portal that keeps your records, wearables data, and results in one place, plus continuity of care when you travel. Labs, imagi",
